'''Balfrug Kreeyath''' is a three-faced [[black demon]] who [[Battle of Ullek|destroyed]] the desert city of [[Ullek]] during the [[God Wars]]. He is one of [[K'ril Tsutsaroth]]'s bodyguards, along with [[Zakl'n Gritch]] and [[Tstanon Karlak]]. He attacks with [[Magic]] by launching huge fireballs at the player and has a maximum hit of 16.

Balfrug Kreeyath is considered a black demon for the purpose of a [[Slayer task]]. As with most demons, he is susceptible to the effects of [[demonbane weapons]].

