==Trivia==
*Balfrug's name is similar to the {{Wp|Balrog}}, a huge demon in {{Wp|The Lord of the Rings}}. However [[K'ril Tsutsaroth]] bears more of a resemblance to it.
*He may be based off {{Wp|Dante's Satan}}, as both are portrayed with three faces and devilish looks.

